活動\n活動日期：5/15（五晚）-5/17（日）\n限定店舖：西門店\n價格：$330（買一送一）\n活動時間：\n5/15（五）17:00-22:00\n5/17（日）11:30-21:00\n\n備注：\n買一送一活動僅限招牌丸舢拉麵單一品項，且需當下兌換完畢，若單人用餐有食量考量，可與店員溝通麵少或不加麵。\n\n活動為西門店限定，市府店、光華店暫無販售。\n\n以現場銷售情況為主，售完為止！",1]]],[1778525491,1794336691],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMRIpLEvamp7oipDjzmBckF2quehKd9_CFV__5m\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMRIpLEvamp7oipDjzmBckF2quehKd9_CFV__5m"]],"4502628771526562779","3656353916023747638",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dd777865217e22ae8\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E4%B8%B8%E8%88%A2%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E5%B8%82%E5%BA%9C%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d13294428349241161717\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIqyrLXUqeXa8wE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEIqyrLXUqeXa8wE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F3656353916023747638%2FlocalPosts%2F4502628771526562779/version/1778525491223000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCNunrZKwoKO-PhIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSXF5ckxYVXFlWGE4d0UaE0Nnd0lzOHFJMEFZUWtOakdwd0k\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E4%B8%B8%E8%88%A2%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E5%B8%82%E5%BA%9C%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d13294428349241161717\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIqyrLXUqeXa8wE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5V_40rLACLLgnsbiFhmcYd4","0ahUKEwiKm9zsvdKWAxX5a_UHHTjVA6AQ544CCLsCKDY",null,"2026年5月12日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u3656353916023747638/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM0NTAyNjI4NzcxNTI2NTYyNzc5","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u3656353916023747638/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM0NTAyNjI4NzcxNTI2NTYyNzc5",null,null,null,null,null,["4502628771526562779","CIHM0ogKEIqyrLXUqeXa8wE","CgwIs8qI0AYQkNjGpwI"]]],1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["規劃行程"],[9],null,null,null,null,n